    "detailed_description": "Start from nothing and rise to the top as you expand your criminal empire in Drug Lord Tycoon. You'll begin as a low-level street hustler working out of a tiny back-alley garage. With aspirations of power and wealth you rise through the ranks, hire workers, and gain access to powerful contacts in the criminal underworld.<br><br>Becoming a succesful kingpin is not easy, and there are a lot of risks and dangers you have to take into account. Avoiding police, rival drug cartels, and insane partners, is all a part of running a drug empire. So be careful who you mess with, or become powerful enough to be the danger!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2450700/extras/8b73ca8d04779e155f39bc12a5bfd382.poster.avif?t=1722431262\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2450700/extras/8b73ca8d04779e155f39bc12a5bfd382.webm?t=1722431262\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br>Grow weed, synthesize meth, and more!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2450700/extras/c04c0181ebfc8fb34d8e1e18c6facbd4.poster.avif?t=1722431262\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2450700/extras/c04c0181ebfc8fb34d8e1e18c6facbd4.webm?t=1722431262\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br>Hire workers to help manage your empire!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2450700/extras/9776ca565b0df2fd6cb26a4c70c6404d.poster.avif?t=1722431262\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets